      <description align="center" color="purple" colored="true" height="525" resized="true" width="297" x="10" y="11">Compute inferred tag&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Author:&lt;br&gt;Akshay Hasabe&lt;br&gt;Naveen Kumar&lt;br&gt;Karthik Sanagapalli&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Overview:&lt;br&gt;Inferred tags are computed in real-time using PI tag values or constants based on logic from tag, model_tag, and inferred_details tables. Only tags marked as inferred are processed, ensuring accurate, model-specific insights through evaluated formula expressions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Input:&lt;br&gt;I/P 1: tag_Details&lt;br&gt;I/P 2: Timestamp tag_data&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Output:&lt;br&gt;1. Timestamp&lt;br&gt;tag data&lt;br&gt;</description>
